e","rotation":"0"}],"files_count":101,"item_last_updated":1702747434,"item_size":141962919,"metadata":{"identifier":"CANDY032","title":"Christmasasaurus vol. 2","creator":"Various Artists","mediatype":"audio","collection":["candymind","netlabels","netlabels"],"description":"For the first time ever the Candy Mind crew stands back to let Peppermint Pony and Bubblegum Octopus present their second Christmas compilation, featuring 24 artists and their view of what a perfect Christmas sounds like.\n\nThe artists performing on this album do not hold any ownership over the songs, except tracks 10, 14, and 19. \nAll interpretations (c) by their respectable creators. ho ho ho!\n\nPeppermint Pony and Bubblegum Octopus says thanks:\nTo all of the very talented artists who contributed their time and skills to share their love for the Christmas season with everyone who wants to listen, to Candymind Records for taking the time and effort to release this album and give us all the support we need (and a place to host the album), to all of the fans who listen to one [or a number] of these artists and take the time to listen to the other songs on the album and support the artists they like, and to everyone else who has helped any of us along the way.\n\nInquiries:\nPeppermint Pony (dingle) - dingleberryfinn777@yahoo.com\nBubblegum Octopus (m@) - realjazzycat@comcast.com\n\nArtwork: Joey Mariano\n\nTRACKLIST\n\n01 Bubblyfish - Sleigh Ride\n02 Hai! Robotto - God Rest Ye Merry Gentlemen\n03 Orange Door West - Little Drummer Fetus\n04 Temp Sound Solutions - Dance of the Sugar Plum Faeries\n05 Lameboy - Joy To The World\n06 c-c - Night Before Bit Mess\n07 Kamakaze Kitten - Sleigh Ride\n08 Animal Style - Al Hanisism\n09 Unicorn Dream Attack - L1ttl3 Drumm3r B0y\n10 Here Comes the Gut Wagon - Electric Santa Claws\n11 Nikaena Vizukae - O Holy Night\n12 Alien Tax Invader - Silent Night...Deadly Night\n13 Goto80 - Feed The World\n14 ipaghost - Mr. Heat Miser\n15 Swat That Fly! - Feliz Navidid\n16 Dorothy's Magic Bag - Jingle Well in Jingle Hell\n17 Peppermint Pony - Deck the Halls\n18 Bit Shifter - Winter Wonderland\n19 Hallowed Butchery - Casulties of Christmas\n20 Scissor Shock - Silent Night\n21 8-bit w0nder - Dance of the Sugar Plum Sprites\n22 3P1L3PT1C F1T - Lil Drum Boy\n23 A Beautiful Lotus - Auld Lang Syn\n24 (Bonus Track) Bubblegum Octopus - We Wish You A Merry Christmas!\n\nARTIST INFO\n\nBubblyfish - www.bubblyfish.com\n\nHai! Robotto - www.myspace.com/hairobotto\n\nOrange Door - West www.myspace.com/orangedoorwest\n\nTemp Sound Solutions - www.tempsoundsolutions.com\n\nLameboy - www.lowgain-audio.com\n\nc-c - www.myspace.com/cocacolah\n\nKamakaze Kitten - www.myspace.com/kamakazekitten\n\nAnimal Style - www.animal-style.com\n\nUnicorn Dream Attack - www.myspace.com/unicorndreamattack\n\nHere Comes the Gut Wagon - www.myspace.com/herecomesthegutwagon\n\nNikaena Vizukae - www.myspace.com/nikaenavizukae\n\nAlien Tax Invader - www.myspace.com/alientaxinvader\n\nGoto80 - www.goto80.com\n\nipaghost - www.myspace.com/ipaghost\n\nSwat That Fly! - www.myspace.com/swatthatfly\n\nDorothy's Magic Bag - www.dmb.candymind.com\n\nPeppermint Pony - www.custommusicrecords.com/pp.html\n\nBit Shifter - www.bit.shifter.net\n\nHallowed Butchery - www.myspace.com/hallowedbutchery\n\nScissor Shock - www.myspace.com/scissorshock\n\n8-Bit w0nder - www.myspace.com/8bitw0nder\n\n3P1L3PT1CF1T - www.myspace.com/cokedragon\n\nA Beautiful Lotus - www.abeautifullotus.com\n\nBubblegum Octopus - www.myspace.com/bubblegumoctopus","date":"2006-12-22","year":"2006","subject":"christmas, candymind, electronica, chip, 8-bit, IDM","pick":"1","publicdate":"2006-12-23 07:38:07","addeddate":"2006-12-23 07:37:49","uploader":"info@candymind.com","updater":["Candy Mind","Candy Mind","Candy Mind","simon c"],"updatedate":["2006-12-23 07:46:08","2006-12-23 20:26:14","2006-12-24 22:24:37","2006-12-31 04:56:20"],"taper":"Candy Mind","source":"Candy Mind","filesxml":"Wed Sep 17 3:50:22 UTC 2014","boxid":"OL100020512","backup_location":"ia903600_27"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"Yihaaa! Candy Mind has done it again! Be Sure to check out this bonkers compilations with really funny christmas covers.","reviewtitle":"Christmasasaurus!!","stars":"5","reviewer":"Buddha Palm","createdate":"2006-12-24 21:56:52","reviewdate":"2006-12-24 21:56:52"},{"reviewbody":"Really cool release, you should definately check out the other releases from candymind.com. Very original and interesting label that is pushing the boundaries for contemporary music.","reviewtitle":"Candy!!!!","stars":"5","reviewer":"The Persuader","createdate":"2006-12-25 03:51:57","reviewdate":"2006-12-25 03:51:57"},{"reviewbody":"I almost laughed my pants of over this comp. The christmas spirit is there for sure and the music is great/funny!!!","reviewtitle":"Chippy christmas!","stars":"5","reviewer":"Billybob303","createdate":"2006-12-25 04:00:54","reviewdate":"2006-12-25 04:00:54"},{"reviewbody":"This is amazing. I LOVE Scissor Shock.","reviewtitle":"awesome","reviewer":"polysicsarebest","reviewdate":"2007-08-05 23:10:25","createdate":"2007-08-05 23:10:25","stars":"5"},{"reviewtitle":"Xmas music. Finally","reviewbody":"The holidays just got better \ud83d\udca5","stars":"5","reviewer":"Fl\u00e2neuses","reviewdate":"2023-12-16 17:23:39","createdate":"2023-12-16 17:23:39","reviewer_itemname":"@fl_neuses"}],"server":"dn601303.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn601303":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5525952675"},"sys_last_changed":"2026-07-27 09:28:47.670532"}}},"solo":true,"uniq":1901067803,"workable_servers":["dn601303.us.archive.org"]}